1
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:22,860
=Heart Signal: Into the Wild=

2
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,320
Celebrate

3
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,000
that we're all gathered here today.

4
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,960
Hello. We meet again.

5
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,200
This is crazy.

6
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:39,880
Oh my god.

7
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:40,800
So hot.

8
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,640
This place is made for falling in love.

9
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,050
Muah.

10
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,200
A family of three.

11
00:00:57,440 --> 00:01:00,880
It feels more real, like there are
more traces of everyday life.

12
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,800
I was a little worried

13
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:03,760
about whether everyone will change

14
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:04,520
once we leave the house.

15
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:05,400
Honestly, no.

16
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,280
It only got better.

17
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,600
I feel so blessed.

18
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,160
Everyone I care about
is right by my side.

19
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:27,780
(Beijing to Ulanqab. Departure day)

20
00:01:28,340 --> 00:01:37,860
(9:00 AM,
Beijing South Railway Station)

21
00:01:41,180 --> 00:01:43,540
(Yu Yang)

22
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:49,020
(Slinking up closer)

23
00:01:49,060 --> 00:01:51,180
(Totally clueless)

24
00:01:54,180 --> 00:01:55,740
(Leaning in)

25
00:01:59,260 --> 00:02:00,740
(Spotted him)

26
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:03,000
You scared the hell out of me.

27
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:04,640
(Snuggling up)
Where did you even come from?

28
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,880
I've been standing behind you.

29
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,440
Really?

30
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:10,010
I was wondering why I couldn't see you.

31
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:10,590
I was right there.

32
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:13,280
Did you miss me?

33
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,120
Yes.

34
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,520
I brought you a drink.

35
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,080
Thanks.

36
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:21,880
And breakfast, too.

37
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:26,280
What's this?

38
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,200
A little gift for you.

39
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,000
A little lamb?

40
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,360
How cute.

41
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:37,760
(Happy Family (4))
Si,

42
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,120
(Good night.)
how's packing going?

43
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,360
We're downstairs now.

44
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,200
Should we head up or...

45
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,320
Are you guys almost done?

46
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,480
Just tell her to let us know

47
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,320
when they're ready,

48
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:48,320
so we can go up and get them.

49
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,040
(On it)
Let us know when you're ready,

50
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,040
and we'll head up.

51
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,240
Let's wait for them downstairs first.

52
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:55,600
Sure.

53
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:55,880
Okay.

54
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:56,760
Let's go.

55
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,560
We're all packed.

56
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,480
Come on up.

57
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,440
Just got the message.

58
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:03,280
We're meeting again.

59
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,540
(Smiles)

60
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,760
You two look so gorgeous today.

61
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:20,860
(Flattery machine on full blast)

62
00:03:20,860 --> 00:03:21,520
Different vibes though.

63
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:23,280
Your styles are totally different today.

64
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,480
You guys look pretty sharp, too.

65
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,240
(Complimenting back)
Well, naturally.

66
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:27,120
We never look bad.

67
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,480
Shall we get going then?

68
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,240
Let's go.

69
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:30,680
Xing,

70
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,120
you put on

71
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,040
this luggage tag, too?

72
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:36,620
(Matching couple luggage tags)

73
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,080
(Confession night)
There are two luggage tags,

74
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:39,560
and on the back of each tag,

75
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,400
it's engraved with our initials.

76
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,200
You're "XY",

77
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,620
(Custom luggage tags)
and I'm "BH".

78
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,560
It's nice.

79
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,040
Your dream is to travel the world,

80
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:51,400
so I feel like
it's not just a luggage tag.

81
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,520
It's also my promise to your dream.

82
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:56,860
(The luggage tag
represents my promise to you)

83
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,760
I want to take you

84
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,800
to so many places you want to go to

85
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,840
but haven't been yet.

86
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:05,500
(I want to take you
anywhere you want to go)

87
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,880
Yeah, it's our

88
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:11,400
first time

89
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:12,880
traveling together, right?

90
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,320
This is the most complete group of 13...

91
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,080
We've ever had.

92
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:20,500
(Full squad assembled for the trip)
Yeah, the most complete ever.

93
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:22,680
I was so excited last night

94
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,960
I could barely sleep.

95
00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:25,340
(Insomnia)

96
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,320
Cui Yihang, were you like that too?

97
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:29,360
I only slept for two hours last night.

98
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,640
What about you, Xing?

99
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,200
Too hyped to sleep.

100
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:33,840
(Xing +1)
Didn't sleep?

101
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:34,200
What about you?

102
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,520
Too excited?

103
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:36,480
(Si +1)
Same here.

104
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:37,280
You too?

105
00:04:37,440 --> 00:04:38,740
We were just dancing around
out of excitement.

106
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:40,060
(Kidding)

107
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:40,860
Is it?

108
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,260
(Looking at Wu Xingying)

109
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,240
Then dance for us when we get there.

110
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,260
I will if you do.

111
00:04:48,260 --> 00:04:49,980
(Like I even know how)

112
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,240
See you in a bit.

113
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,680
So pretty.

114
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:54,880
Give it a close-up.

115
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,160
It's my first time buying flowers

116
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,400
packaged in a box like this.

117
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,840
It's also my first time receiving this.

118
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:00,520
Really?

119
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:01,320
Yeah.

120
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:05,060
Hello.

121
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,760
Thanks, babe.

122
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:11,500
(Helping with the luggage)

123
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,600
The flowers Cao Yiheng gave me.

124
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:16,400
(Exchanging gifts)
The sunglasses Cui Kaiyi gave me.

125
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:19,320
And he said
he didn't like wearing sunglasses.

126
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,120
Well, I like wearing them now.

127
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,880
Nice, looks great.

128
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,760
When I meet everyone later,

129
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,960
I'm going to hold these flowers up high.

130
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,040
Plus, it matches

131
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,000
my outfit so well.

132
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:30,560
Look.

133
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,600
It really does.

134
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,240
Right?

135
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:34,800
Yeah.

136
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,920
The colors really match.

137
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,120
I won't wear that jacket.

138
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,160
I'll wear this the whole time.

139
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:40,280
I'm in the car now,

140
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:43,360
and I'm heading to meet up

141
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,040
with the rest

142
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,040
of the gang.

143
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,560
On my way to the meetup point right now.

144
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,520
I'm about to see everyone real soon.

145
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:51,000
So excited.

146
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,960
Can't wait to hang out...

147
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:53,560
With everyone.

148
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:56,800
Gonna see Cui Kaiyi super soon.

149
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:06,920
Let's go.

150
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,700
(Sun Bohan, Wu Xingying,
Cui Yihang, Wu Siying arrived)

151
00:06:12,900 --> 00:06:14,500
(Chen Hewen arrived)

152
00:06:14,780 --> 00:06:16,460
(Liang Renfang, Yu Yang arrived)

153
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:18,020
(Cao Yiheng, Cui Kaiyi arrived)

154
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:20,420
(Sun Qimeng, Liang Xiaoyu arrived)

155
00:06:20,660 --> 00:06:21,740
(Sha Yue'er, Zhao Xilun arrived)

156
00:06:23,770 --> 00:06:24,620
Hello.

157
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,560
Hi, Chen Hewen.

158
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,000
A family of four, huh?

159
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:34,040
Hi.

160
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:37,880
Hello.

161
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,600
Long time no see.

162
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:40,800
Long time no see.

163
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,360
Everyone looks better.

164
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,240
Not you. I meant Si.

165
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,240
Look at him grinning.

166
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,000
He got the wrong idea.

167
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,120
You came back from Hangzhou?

168
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:52,800
Just landed yesterday.

169
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,480
Landed again, huh?

170
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,120
How did you know?

171
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:57,000
Alright.

172
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,180
(Xing's Husband)
Xing's husband, huh?

173
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,200
I ship you two.

174
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:03,480
Really.

175
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,400
Do you need to use the restroom?

176
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,760
Real quick.

177
00:07:18,340 --> 00:07:20,060
(Accompanying)

178
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,480
Protein bar.

179
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:28,600
Give one to Chen Hewen.

180
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,400
Chen Hewen.

181
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,120
What's this?

182
00:07:31,380 --> 00:07:32,360
Protein bar.

183
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,160
Thanks.

184
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:45,440
What's wrong?

185
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:46,240
(Holding hands)
Are you hungry?

186
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,160
No.

187
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:50,720
My bag's too stuffed.
Just clearing it out.

188
00:07:51,260 --> 00:07:53,580
(Sugar overload in progress)

189
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:55,940
(Kinda cute)

190
00:08:01,820 --> 00:08:03,500
(Distracting attention)
Over here. It's blocking the view.

191
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,280
Maybe I should sit in the back row.

192
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:16,280
Here they come.

193
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,320
Who?

194
00:08:17,470 --> 00:08:18,440
Yu Yang.

195
00:08:18,660 --> 00:08:20,330
Hello.

196
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,080
Hello.

197
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:23,040
Hi.

198
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,520
Hello, Fang, long time no see.

199
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:25,200
We're here.

200
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:25,720
Hello.

201
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,800
Hello, Yu Yang.

202
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:28,840
Hello, Fang.

203
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:29,520
It's been so long.

204
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,520
We finally met up.

205
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:31,800
You can sit anywhere.

206
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,640
Okay.

207
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:33,120
Hi.

208
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:33,720
Hello, Fang.

209
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,080
Hey.

210
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,360
I feel like Cui Yihang lost weight, too.

211
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,110
I feel like you've lost weight.

212
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:37,670
Did I?

213
00:08:37,670 --> 00:08:38,100
Nope.

214
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,100
(Nope)

215
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,480
Do you want me to compliment you?

216
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,000
No.

217
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,760
You're the last person
I'd want a compliment from.

218
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:49,400
How have you guys been lately? Busy?

219
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:50,960
Super busy. I just...

220
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:54,440
I just got back from Jinan this morning.

221
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:58,640
Hi.

222
00:08:58,640 --> 00:08:59,520
Hello.

223
00:08:59,520 --> 00:09:00,320
Hi.

224
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,480
Hello, Cui Kaiyi.

225
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,280
Hello, Cao Yiheng.

226
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,360
Hello.

227
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,160
Long time no see.

228
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,720
Long time no see.

229
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,160
Hello.

230
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,080
Hey.

231
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:13,960
Hello again.

232
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,920
Hi.

233
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:16,560
Xing.

234
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,160
You look so good.

235
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,320
Look at those cute sunglasses.

236
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:24,140
Today is our 90-day anniversary.

237
00:09:24,140 --> 00:09:24,680
(FangYang couple)

238
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:25,240
(and HengYi couple)
Yeah.

239
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:25,860
(hit 90 days together)
Yep.

240
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,960
I got a gift too. Mine's flowers.

241
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,520
Mine's a little lamb.

242
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,760
Hello.

243
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:35,800
Hi.

244
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:37,960
Hello, Meng.

245
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,160
Hurry over.

246
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:39,720
Hello.

247
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,560
Meng.

248
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,040
"Lucky Guy" got handsome.

249
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,600
Hello.

250
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,920
Everyone's here.

251
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,200
Hello.

252
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,040
Hello.

253
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:49,840
Hey.

254
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,680
Hi.

255
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,800
Missed you guys.

256
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,360
I brought some snacks for everyone.

257
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:54,880
Awesome.

258
00:09:54,970 --> 00:09:55,780
You're a lifesaver.

259
00:09:55,780 --> 00:09:56,960
We've been waiting for this bag.

260
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:59,180
I saved these seats just for you guys.

261
00:09:59,180 --> 00:10:00,120
Really?

262
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,560
All three of us
are going to eat them all.

263
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:05,380
(Sharing snacks)

264
00:10:07,560 --> 00:10:09,000
Ding ding ding.

265
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,400
Hi.

266
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,520
Long time no see.

267
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:12,660
Hello.

268
00:10:12,660 --> 00:10:13,820
(Everyone has arrived)

269
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,800
Here are some gifts Yu Yang picked up

270
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,280
while away on a business trip.

271
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:22,800
Thanks.

272
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:23,920
Thank you.

273
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:24,640
Thanks.

274
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:25,840
Help yourselves.

275
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,520
Thanks, Yu Yang.

276
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,800
Thanks, Yu Yang.

277
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:38,460
(Grinning)

278
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,000
I'm sending this to my mom.

279
00:10:41,060 --> 00:10:42,620
(Checking in with Mom)

280
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:48,160
Help me scratch it.

281
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:48,580
Itchy?

282
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,800
Yeah.

283
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,280
Is it here?

284
00:10:58,180 --> 00:10:59,780
(Snuggling close)

285
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:11,980
(Looking)

286
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:18,360
Hello.

287
00:11:18,370 --> 00:11:19,080
Hi.

288
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:20,920
Come on, Mr. Chen.

289
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:21,840
Just wanted to let you guys know.

290
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,480
Something came up

291
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:24,920
so I can't make it right now.

292
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,280
Then when are you coming?

293
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:31,720
I'll meet up with you guys later.

294
00:11:32,570 --> 00:11:33,680
You guys go ahead and head out first.

295
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:34,520
I won't hold you up.

296
00:11:34,590 --> 00:11:35,640
No worries.

297
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:36,640
Take care of your business first.

298
00:11:37,410 --> 00:11:38,120
Bye.

299
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,350
Bye bye.

300
00:11:39,350 --> 00:11:40,120
We'll be waiting.

301
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:40,920
See you later.

302
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:43,980
Buckle up.

303
00:11:43,980 --> 00:11:44,800
(Safe travel, seatbelts fastened)

304
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:45,240
Is your buckle

305
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:45,560
here,

306
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,240
babe?

307
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:47,640
Yep.

308
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,060
(Imitating)
Yep.

309
00:11:49,380 --> 00:11:50,220
(Smiles)

310
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:51,440
Carsick.

311
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:54,040
I have a motion sickness patch
in my bag.

312
00:11:54,220 --> 00:11:56,500
(Prepared motion sickness patches)

313
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,760
Off we go.

314
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:03,880
So hyped.

315
00:12:12,800 --> 00:12:13,800
There's a monkey here.

316
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,000
Off on a trip.

317
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:19,160
The reason we're all gathered here today

318
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,040
is to...

319
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:22,400
Celebrate that we're all
gathered here today.

320
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:25,080
Stating the obvious.

321
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:26,440
Finally,

322
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,360
We have Meng with us.

323
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,440
And Xing, too.

324
00:12:29,880 --> 00:12:31,000
Xing's husband and Xing.

325
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:33,210
That's right.

326
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,240
So Meng,

327
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,080
how have you been lately?

328
00:12:36,290 --> 00:12:37,520
Just grinding away at work

329
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,120
every day.

330
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:38,840
Okay.

331
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,440
Some customers

332
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,320
actually recognized her.

333
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,120
Yeah, they came

334
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,480
to my service counter.

335
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:44,040
Yeah.

336
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:45,640
It was actually pretty funny.

337
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:46,880
What about you, Liang Xiaoyu?

338
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:47,960
Yeah, Liang Xiaoyu.

339
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,000
Just working.

340
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:49,840
Working.

341
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,480
Yeah.

342
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:51,560
Cui Kaiyi and Zhao Xilun,

343
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:52,520
are you guys starting school soon?

344
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,200
Suddenly?

345
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,200
Yeah.

346
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,480
Yeah.

347
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,800
Cui Kaiyi already started.

348
00:12:58,800 --> 00:12:59,200
Yeah.

349
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,240
She's based in Beijing now.

350
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,320
Just the other day in the bathhouse,

351
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:04,080
my hair wasn't even dry yet,

352
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:04,640
and then

353
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:05,600
my socials...

354
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,440
Sha Yue'er sent me a message saying,

355
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,840
"Cui Kaiyi, did you go take a bath?"

356
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:12,480
People recognized you?

357
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,680
You got photographed?

358
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:14,480
No, no photos.

359
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,560
They didn't even say hi to me.

360
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:16,880
(Completely clueless)
I had no idea.

361
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:19,120
That's hilarious.

362
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:20,880
Fang has been super busy lately,

363
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:21,440
right?

364
00:13:21,640 --> 00:13:24,000
Her musical tour has started.

365
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,840
We definitely have to watch it.

366
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:28,360
Yeah.

367
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,280
Definitely.

368
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,760
Yu Yang, organize it next time.

369
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:31,640
Sneak us in to watch.

370
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:32,440
Yeah.

371
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,600
We'll quietly record it.

372
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,840
(Surprise factor)
Yeah, let's sneak in.

373
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,040
We'll go early,

374
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:37,560
(Scheming)
and snap up all the front-row tickets.

375
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:38,560
(Mind racing)
All of them.

376
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,760
The first row is the interactive zone.

377
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:45,680
If I see you guys,
I'm coming straight down.

378
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,200
Really?

379
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:47,440
I'll come right down.

380
00:13:58,140 --> 00:13:59,740
(Grinning)

381
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,360
Why are you smiling?

382
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,280
Because you look cute.

383
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:04,280
No.

384
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:05,160
That's not it.

385
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,640
You're funny.

386
00:14:06,640 --> 00:14:07,440
That's why I'm smiling.

387
00:14:09,180 --> 00:14:10,380
(Pinching)

388
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,180
My bad, my bad.

389
00:14:11,180 --> 00:14:12,100
(Apologizing immediately)

390
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:13,760
The thing is,

391
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:15,240
a person needs to get enough sleep.

392
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:16,880
Once you sleep well,

393
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:19,520
your whole mood
just gets so much better.

394
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:20,080
Don't you think?

395
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:25,960
Is that too cheesy?

396
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,040
Yes.

397
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:28,840
Really?

398
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,360
Let me degrease you a bit.

399
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:31,720
Aren't you

400
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:33,840
the "Xing Brand"

401
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:34,800
dish soap?

402
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,700
I want...

403
00:14:40,700 --> 00:14:41,660
(Hinting)

404
00:14:42,460 --> 00:14:43,980
(Continue hinting)

405
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,800
People are around.

406
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:49,620
(Catching a quick nap)

407
00:14:57,140 --> 00:15:00,180
(Helping draw the curtains)

408
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:04,880
It's kind of tiring, right?

409
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:05,960
It was so funny.

410
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:06,760
You're tired?

411
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,720
If you're tired, we can swap seats.

412
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:10,920
Lie sideways like that

413
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:11,640
is more comfortable.

414
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:13,440
I'm not sleeping.

415
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,680
It's nice over there.

416
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:20,760
It's nice over there.

417
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,200
It kind of gives off Zhangjiajie vibes.

418
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,560
So many mountains.

419
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:30,920
It's all mountains over there.

420
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:32,360
The altitude is going up.

421
00:15:32,800 --> 00:15:33,400
When you go hiking,

422
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:34,920
do you climb mountains like this?

423
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:36,480
Yeah, it's all mountains like this.

424
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,400
Look, the clouds look amazing.

425
00:15:42,690 --> 00:15:44,380
We've reached my grandma's hometown.

426
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:46,680
Your grandma's hometown?

427
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:47,710
Zhangjiakou.

428
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:49,640
We should go visit her
if we get the chance.

429
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:52,200
Should we

430
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,040
recite a poem?

431
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:55,400
Play word association.

432
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,080
A writer.

433
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:56,920
The writer is right here.

434
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,320
He's the writer?

435
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,440
We do have a writer here.

436
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:05,100
Happy weekend.

437
00:16:10,680 --> 00:16:12,160
(Safe travel, seatbelts fastened)
♪Don't stay trapped in your room♪

438
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:13,520
♪Outside the window,
the rain has cleared♪

439
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:14,880
♪Set reality aside♪

440
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:16,120
♪Follow your heart♪

441
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,360
♪What you've been longing
for is right ahead♪

442
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,760
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

443
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:21,400
♪Just be a little braver♪

444
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:24,400
♪Come closer, come closer♪

445
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:27,920
♪There's a little spark
shining in your eyes♪

446
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:30,160
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

447
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:35,800
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

448
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:42,120
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

449
00:16:45,680 --> 00:16:50,000
♪You are my little star♪

450
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:52,920
Sing it to Xing.

451
00:16:52,920 --> 00:16:53,720
One more time.

452
00:16:54,680 --> 00:16:55,480
One more time.

453
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:56,840
♪You♪

454
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,400
No, face that way.

455
00:16:57,400 --> 00:16:57,840
Face that way.

456
00:16:58,640 --> 00:16:59,680
Sing to her.

457
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:01,120
♪You♪

458
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:04,360
♪are my little star♪

459
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:08,320
(Watching the sweet scene)
♪Shining bright up in the sky♪

460
00:17:08,320 --> 00:17:09,400
So romantic.

461
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:13,160
♪Da da da, be together♪

462
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,720
Grasslands, here we come.

463
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,680
Here we come.

464
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,320
We're really in the grasslands now.

465
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:28,760
So pretty.

466
00:17:31,560 --> 00:17:32,320
There are horses too.

467
00:17:32,320 --> 00:17:33,880
Is that a horse?
That black one over there.

468
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:35,200
A horse.

469
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:38,900
There are sheep.

470
00:17:39,510 --> 00:17:39,960
Sheep.

471
00:17:39,990 --> 00:17:40,890
There are actual sheep.

472
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:41,920
Here I come.

473
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:42,560
I'm here.

474
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:45,880
Yu Yang.

475
00:17:46,180 --> 00:17:47,580
(Baa)

476
00:17:51,520 --> 00:17:52,600
Let's all hold up our mics,

477
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:53,280
shall we?

478
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:56,680
♪I still can't part with you♪

479
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:59,800
♪Can't part with you♪

480
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:02,080
♪Your smile♪

481
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:06,800
♪is the greatest thing
I live for in this lifetime♪

482
00:18:07,360 --> 00:18:08,600
♪Let's keep each other company♪

483
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:10,520
♪Living life to the fullest♪

484
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:12,120
♪Riding horses together♪

485
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:14,360
♪Sharing all the world's wonders♪

486
00:18:14,360 --> 00:18:15,640
♪Singing out loud over drinks♪

487
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,800
♪Singing out the joy in our hearts♪

488
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:19,080
♪Living with passion♪

489
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:23,000
♪Grasping our youth♪

490
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,200
Living with passion.

491
00:18:48,760 --> 00:18:50,520
That place right up ahead
is where we're staying.

492
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:53,160
It's huge.

493
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:00,200
It's made of wood, look.

494
00:19:06,800 --> 00:19:08,200
This is so nice.

495
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:10,280
There are yurts over there, too.

496
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:21,280
Pure bliss.

497
00:19:22,520 --> 00:19:24,440
Sunlight Grassland Natural Village.

498
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:28,160
Let's go.

499
00:19:31,480 --> 00:19:32,240
It's so cool out here.

500
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:34,840
This temperature feels amazing.

501
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,520
So pretty.

502
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,080
So refreshing.

503
00:19:40,080 --> 00:19:40,560
It's so cool.

504
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:42,480
So pretty.

505
00:19:42,480 --> 00:19:43,400
I'll go get the suitcases.

506
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,500
Can you do it?

507
00:19:44,540 --> 00:19:46,100
(Helping out)

508
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,960
This one is Si's, right?

509
00:19:48,240 --> 00:19:48,550
Yeah.

510
00:19:48,550 --> 00:19:49,120
(Helping with luggage)
I got it.

511
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,300
Let me grab something for you.

512
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:51,680
Thanks.

513
00:19:51,680 --> 00:19:52,800
Could you grab this one for me?

514
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:55,080
Let me help you carry it.

515
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:55,920
No need.

516
00:19:56,080 --> 00:19:57,360
Let's go.

517
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,760
There are horses.

518
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:00,040
Horsies.

519
00:20:01,420 --> 00:20:02,620
(Human, welcome)

520
00:20:02,640 --> 00:20:03,680
Can you push that?

521
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:04,520
Yeah.

522
00:20:05,380 --> 00:20:06,900
(Helping)

523
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:07,600
You guys

524
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:08,080
are hilarious.

525
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,680
Uphill photo.

526
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:11,640
Too funny.

527
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:15,320
Hello.

528
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:17,310
(Guesthouse Manager)
"Hello".

529
00:20:18,520 --> 00:20:19,320
"Hello".

530
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,840
"Hello" means hello.

531
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:24,480
"Hello"?

532
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:24,960
Hello.

533
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:25,760
Hello everyone.

534
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:27,800
"Hello".

535
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:28,520
Hi everyone.

536
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:28,920
Hello.

537
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:30,040
Hi.

538
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:31,240
Welcome to Inner Mongolia.

539
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:32,600
I'm your host.

540
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:36,000
We've prepared
six wooden cabins over here.

541
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:37,320
The one directly across from me

542
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:38,200
has two floors,

543
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:39,920
and you can see the lake
from the second floor.

544
00:20:40,840 --> 00:20:42,480
Every room has its own unique charm.

545
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:45,120
We've also put together

546
00:20:45,120 --> 00:20:46,720
a variety of special local activities.

547
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:48,360
(Notice board)
We're throwing a campfire party

548
00:20:48,360 --> 00:20:49,920
(Outdoor campfire dinner at the ranch)
at our ranch down in the countryside.

549
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,880
I hope everyone
will have a blast over there.

550
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:53,960
Wishing you all

551
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,320
a fun and unforgettable trip.

552
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:57,320
Thank you.

553
00:20:57,320 --> 00:20:58,400
Aren't you cold in that?

554
00:20:58,400 --> 00:20:59,120
Perhaps a little?

555
00:20:59,120 --> 00:20:59,920
Yeah.

556
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:00,560
Right?

557
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:01,760
It'll probably get even colder tonight.

558
00:21:01,760 --> 00:21:02,800
You're underdressed.

559
00:21:02,800 --> 00:21:03,920
Yeah, I need to bundle up.

560
00:21:03,920 --> 00:21:04,640
When we get our bags,

561
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:06,160
you can pull out a thicker jacket.

562
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:06,880
Yeah.

563
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:08,080
It'll probably be even colder at night.

564
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:10,080
Alright, everyone
can go check out the cabins now.

565
00:21:10,080 --> 00:21:10,600
Okay.

566
00:21:10,600 --> 00:21:11,520
Let's go look together.

567
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:12,280
Okay.

568
00:21:12,600 --> 00:21:13,800
Any room setup works,

569
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:14,800
as long as we're close by each other.

570
00:21:16,320 --> 00:21:17,480
They have this here.

571
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,400
(Telescope)
We can stargaze.

572
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:19,200
A telescope.

573
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:19,960
Yeah.

574
00:21:21,120 --> 00:21:22,680
There's even a mailbox.

575
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:26,240
This one works too.

576
00:21:26,560 --> 00:21:28,080
This one has a balcony like this.

577
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:30,840
Look, here's a stargazing spot.

578
00:21:30,840 --> 00:21:31,640
Yeah, they all have one.

579
00:21:31,940 --> 00:21:33,740
(Great for stargazing at night)

580
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:35,480
It feels pretty nice around here.

581
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:39,080
Look, the clouds
look way more 3D from here.

582
00:21:40,600 --> 00:21:41,720
This works too.

583
00:21:42,320 --> 00:21:43,520
This one's great.

584
00:21:45,120 --> 00:21:46,320
This is actually pretty neat.

585
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:50,360
So beautiful.

586
00:21:50,800 --> 00:21:51,760
So pretty.

587
00:21:51,760 --> 00:21:52,520
They're all great.

588
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:54,680
There are cows over there.

589
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:58,400
So pretty.

590
00:21:58,400 --> 00:21:59,360
Gorgeous.

591
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:01,080
There are sheep too.

592
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:02,360
So pretty.

593
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:05,160
It feels like we're back
at the stargazing room.

594
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,240
Yeah.

595
00:22:06,300 --> 00:22:08,660
