599
00:22:18,840 --> 00:22:19,280
Right?

600
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:21,120
And look at the couple down there.

601
00:22:21,120 --> 00:22:21,680
Whoa.

602
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:23,520
This looks so romantic.

603
00:22:24,320 --> 00:22:24,920
This is nice.

604
00:22:25,600 --> 00:22:27,680
Such a vibe.
Their outfits match so well.

605
00:22:28,100 --> 00:22:28,940
(Couple outfits)

606
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:30,520
They're doing matching outfits again.

607
00:22:30,520 --> 00:22:31,440
Four of us

608
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:32,200
