609
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:33,120
Yeah.

610
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:34,760
These two
are a bit closer to each other.

611
00:22:35,080 --> 00:22:37,080
Should the three of us stay

612
00:22:37,080 --> 00:22:37,800
