616
00:22:39,910 --> 00:22:40,620
(Liang Renfang, Cui Kaiyi: First floor)

617
00:22:40,620 --> 00:22:40,920
Alright.

618
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:42,440
The guys split into pairs, too.

619
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:42,840
Sounds good.

620
00:22:42,840 --> 00:22:44,120
Then what about Chen Hewen?

621
00:22:44,120 --> 00:22:44,960
Give Chen Hewen a call.

622
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:45,360
Ask him

623
00:22:45,360 --> 00:22:46,320
