624
00:22:46,320 --> 00:22:47,680
Alright, let's give him a call.

625
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:51,840
Hello.

626
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:54,440
When are you getting here?

627
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:55,360
Yeah.

628
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:56,200
We've arrived.

629
00:22:56,760 --> 00:22:57,720
Hi, Chen Hewen.

630
00:22:57,720 --> 00:22:59,400
