632
00:23:00,560 --> 00:23:01,240
Pick a room.

633
00:23:01,520 --> 00:23:02,840
You have a special perk now.

634
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:03,920
You get to choose

635
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,560
