640
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:12,720
No problem.

641
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:14,960
See you in a bit.

642
00:23:15,320 --> 00:23:16,640
Bye bye.

643
00:23:18,480 --> 00:23:19,680
He can stay with Chen Hewen.

644
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:20,800
