647
00:23:23,360 --> 00:23:24,080
Alright.

648
00:23:24,140 --> 00:23:24,540
(Cao Yiheng, Chen Hewen)

649
00:23:24,540 --> 00:23:24,900
(Zhao Xilun, Yu Yang)

650
00:23:24,900 --> 00:23:25,330
(Liang Xiaoyu, Sun Qimeng)

651
00:23:25,330 --> 00:23:25,830
(Sha Yue'er, Cui Kaiyi, Liang Renfang)

652
00:23:25,830 --> 00:23:26,220
(Wu Siying, Wu Xingying)

653
00:23:26,220 --> 00:23:26,620
