654
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:28,080
Come on, let me drop off our luggage.

655
00:23:30,320 --> 00:23:30,920
Come on.

656
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:31,920
Let's go.

657
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:34,800
