"Faint light glowing in the eyes."

658
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:36,640
Which bed do you want?

659
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:37,800
Either one is fine by me.

660
00:23:37,800 --> 00:23:38,840
Fang, which side
do you want to sleep on?

661
00:23:38,840 --> 00:23:40,080
Either side is fine by me.

662
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:40,920
Same.

663
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:42,080
I'll set your stuff here, okay?

664
00:23:42,080 --> 00:23:42,880
Okay.

665
00:23:42,900 --> 00:23:44,620
