667
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,280
(Thoughtfully moving luggage)
I'll leave it by the door.

668
00:23:51,280 --> 00:23:52,080
Okay.

669
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:53,560
Is this one yours?

670
00:23:53,840 --> 00:23:54,960
That one isn't.

671
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,280
Yeah, the small one is mine.

672
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:57,020
Okay.

673
00:23:57,020 --> 00:23:58,620
(Peak boyfriend energy)

674
00:23:58,640 --> 00:23:59,840
Don't move it just yet.

675
00:23:59,840 --> 00:24:00,920
I'll grab it in a sec.

676
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:01,360
It's fine.

677
00:24:01,360 --> 00:24:02,000
I'll take this one.

678
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:03,320
Don't grab it.

679
00:24:03,800 --> 00:24:05,120
Here's your small suitcase.

680
00:24:06,300 --> 00:24:07,260
