681
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:08,320
Stop grabbing it.

682
00:24:08,320 --> 00:24:10,040
I'm bringing
your small suitcase over for you.

683
00:24:10,040 --> 00:24:10,680
Yours is light.

684
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:12,200
Be careful with that stone step.

685
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:13,000
Got it.

686
00:24:13,840 --> 00:24:14,720
Be careful.

687
00:24:14,720 --> 00:24:15,120
Got it.

688
00:24:15,120 --> 00:24:15,920
Watch your step.

689
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,320
(Caring)

690
00:24:17,320 --> 00:24:18,160
Watch your step.

691
00:24:22,240 --> 00:24:23,060
Look at how you're walking.

692
00:24:23,060 --> 00:24:24,140
(Laughs)

693
00:24:26,230 --> 00:24:28,840
