We can stargaze right here tonight.

694
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:30,000
Our room is huge.

695
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,640
This room smells so nice.

696
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:33,200
It really does.

697
00:24:33,260 --> 00:24:34,820
