Feels like I need to make two trips.

701
00:24:47,280 --> 00:24:48,040
I'll help you.

702
00:24:48,100 --> 00:24:49,220
(Delivering luggage +3)

703
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:50,720
I'll leave it right here for her.

704
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:52,240
Alright, thanks.

705
00:24:52,880 --> 00:24:54,510
