Where's your thermos?

706
00:24:54,560 --> 00:24:55,480
In my backpack.

707
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:56,480
Hand it to me.

708
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:59,600
Three-legged race.

709
00:24:59,600 --> 00:25:00,400
I'll...

710
00:25:01,520 --> 00:25:03,880
