I'll pour some cold medicine into it.

711
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:05,200
I already warmed it up.

712
00:25:05,600 --> 00:25:06,760
You warmed up the cold medicine?

713
00:25:07,360 --> 00:25:08,160
Where is it?

714
00:25:08,160 --> 00:25:09,200
In my room.

715
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:09,760
Let's go.

716
00:25:10,040 --> 00:25:11,400
