snap a picture for them first.

723
00:25:25,280 --> 00:25:26,440
Your hand is blocking his mouth.

724
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:29,000
One, two, three.

725
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:31,720
I'm here.

726
00:25:31,720 --> 00:25:32,520
Come sit down.

727
00:25:32,520 --> 00:25:33,280
This feels so cozy.

728
00:25:33,600 --> 00:25:34,880
We look like we're in one of those

729
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:36,400
