736
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:10,840
(Presenting Hadag scarves)
Welcome, everyone.

737
00:26:10,840 --> 00:26:11,680
Thank you.

738
00:26:11,680 --> 00:26:12,760
Putting on Hadag scarves.

739
00:26:12,760 --> 00:26:13,200
Thank you.

740
00:26:13,200 --> 00:26:13,640
May all

741
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,200
your wishes come true.

742
00:26:15,600 --> 00:26:16,640
Alright.

743
00:26:18,180 --> 00:26:19,260
(Warmly inviting)

744
00:26:19,280 --> 00:26:20,880
Come on, let's dance together.

745
00:26:20,940 --> 00:26:21,700
(Pulling along)

746
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,680
Okay, thank you.

747
00:26:25,340 --> 00:26:27,180
(Holding hands)
So warm.

748
00:26:29,360 --> 00:26:30,080
Form a circle.

749
00:26:34,040 --> 00:26:35,080
I don't know how to spin anymore.

750
00:26:35,080 --> 00:26:36,120
Me neither.

751
00:26:37,760 --> 00:26:39,120
Fang is so good.

752
00:26:49,160 --> 00:26:50,320
You're so professional.

753
00:26:50,320 --> 00:26:51,160
(Complimenting)
Your shoulders need to move.

754
00:26:53,480 --> 00:26:55,040
Looks like a crab.

755
00:26:55,040 --> 00:26:55,640
What do I do?

756
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:57,360
Looks like a crab.

757
00:26:58,880 --> 00:26:59,800
This is way out of my depth.

758
00:27:00,520 --> 00:27:02,120
We look like we're doing an exorcism.

759
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:03,760
Look at Cui Yihang.

760
00:27:11,820 --> 00:27:13,060
(Cracking up)

761
00:27:13,520 --> 00:27:14,960
First time doing a campfire like this.

762
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:15,760
It's pretty fun.

763
00:27:34,920 --> 00:27:36,600
Thank you.

764
00:27:37,320 --> 00:27:37,880
Thank you.

765
00:27:38,520 --> 00:27:40,880
Come on, right this way, everyone.

766
00:27:41,760 --> 00:27:42,640
Thank you.

767
00:27:42,960 --> 00:27:44,120
Thank you.

768
00:27:44,120 --> 00:27:45,960
Let's sit here.

769
00:27:45,960 --> 00:27:47,240
Sure, I'll sit here.

770
00:27:47,240 --> 00:27:50,760
Come on,
let's bring out the delicious food.

771
00:27:58,360 --> 00:27:59,560
Thank you.

772
00:27:59,560 --> 00:28:01,820
(Local specialties)

773
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:03,280
This smells amazing.

774
00:28:03,520 --> 00:28:04,680
Is this lamb raw?

775
00:28:05,520 --> 00:28:06,040
It's cooked.

776
00:28:06,920 --> 00:28:07,800
Silly girl.

777
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:09,240
Silly girl.

778
00:28:09,760 --> 00:28:10,680
Silly Yue'er.

779
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:12,360
Silly Yue'er.

780
00:28:15,280 --> 00:28:16,200
Time to dig in.

781
00:28:17,360 --> 00:28:19,320
To our friends
visiting from out of town,

782
00:28:19,320 --> 00:28:22,520
(Smiling)
welcome to Ulanqab.

783
00:28:22,520 --> 00:28:24,240
For your arrival,

784
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:27,480
we express our heartfelt gratitude

785
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:28,800
and a warm welcome.

786
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,320
Thank you.

787
00:28:35,320 --> 00:28:36,680
Welcome, everyone,

788
00:28:36,680 --> 00:28:38,240
to our beautiful Ulanqab

789
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:39,520
in Inner Mongolia.

790
00:28:39,520 --> 00:28:40,880
Once again, for your arrival,

791
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:42,080
we express our heartfelt gratitude

792
00:28:42,080 --> 00:28:42,920
and a warm welcome.

793
00:28:42,920 --> 00:28:43,720
Welcome, everyone.

794
00:28:43,720 --> 00:28:45,760
Thank you.

795
00:28:45,760 --> 00:28:47,920
Let me briefly introduce

796
00:28:47,920 --> 00:28:51,600
