797
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:54,480
In Mongolian,
hand-held mutton is called...

798
00:28:54,580 --> 00:28:56,020
(Hand-held mutton)

799
00:29:04,280 --> 00:29:05,680
Pay attention to these Mongolian words.

800
00:29:05,680 --> 00:29:08,120
Be sure to study hard in a bit.

801
00:29:08,120 --> 00:29:09,340
There'll be a quiz time later.

802
00:29:09,340 --> 00:29:10,100
(Quiz time)

803
00:29:18,760 --> 00:29:20,980
(Kidding)
If we fail, we don't get to eat?

804
00:29:24,040 --> 00:29:25,320
For those who speak well,

805
00:29:25,320 --> 00:29:26,480
