806
00:29:27,740 --> 00:29:28,900
(Cramming real quick)

807
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:32,200
Record this.

808
00:29:34,040 --> 00:29:35,340
Roasted lamb chops is...

809
00:29:35,340 --> 00:29:37,260
(Roasted lamb chops)

810
00:29:38,740 --> 00:29:39,820
(Stumbling over words)

811
00:29:42,880 --> 00:29:44,360
Alright, it doesn't matter anymore.

812
00:29:46,320 --> 00:29:47,160
Say it one more time.

813
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:51,800
I don't know the other one.

814
00:29:57,200 --> 00:29:58,420
What was the previous word?

815
00:29:58,420 --> 00:29:59,500
(What was the previous one again?)

816
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:05,340
Milk skin is...

817
00:30:05,340 --> 00:30:07,780
(Milk skin)

818
00:30:07,800 --> 00:30:08,880
This one's easy, right?

819
00:30:09,480 --> 00:30:11,720
And that's milk tofu.

820
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:13,060
(Milk tofu)

821
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:14,760
Right.

822
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:19,000
I've got a question for everyone.

823
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,480
How do you say hand-held mutton?

824
00:30:20,860 --> 00:30:22,660
(Mongolian quiz begins)

825
00:30:29,780 --> 00:30:31,500
(Completely different answers)

826
00:30:31,740 --> 00:30:33,940
(Polite smile)

827
00:30:38,100 --> 00:30:39,260
(Correct)

828
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,220
Hand-held mutton.

829
00:30:40,220 --> 00:30:41,100
(Exactly the same)

830
00:30:43,420 --> 00:30:44,660
(Quick learner)
Not bad.

831
00:30:45,120 --> 00:30:47,240
Another easy one is milk skin.

832
00:30:47,460 --> 00:30:48,580
