833
00:30:48,600 --> 00:30:49,280
Right.

834
00:30:51,300 --> 00:30:53,060
(So impressive)

835
00:30:54,880 --> 00:30:55,820
What about milk tofu?

836
00:30:55,820 --> 00:30:57,020
