837
00:30:59,000 --> 00:30:59,660
Milk tofu?

838
00:30:59,660 --> 00:31:00,660
(No idea)

839
00:31:00,820 --> 00:31:02,580
(No idea)

840
00:31:02,600 --> 00:31:03,640
Which one's the milk tofu?

841
00:31:03,840 --> 00:31:04,400
That one.

842
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:05,200
The one all the way over there.

843
00:31:05,360 --> 00:31:06,880
You couldn't see it from there.

844
00:31:06,880 --> 00:31:08,040
I wasn't even looking over there.

845
00:31:11,420 --> 00:31:12,740
(Correct again)

846
00:31:15,800 --> 00:31:17,320
Let's reward

847
00:31:17,320 --> 00:31:18,480
