849
00:31:19,800 --> 00:31:21,520
specialty.

850
00:31:21,520 --> 00:31:22,320
Mongolian milk tea.

851
00:31:33,580 --> 00:31:34,300
(Mongolian milk tea,
a traditional specialty)

852
00:31:34,300 --> 00:31:34,900
(Made by simmering brick tea with milk)

853
00:31:34,900 --> 00:31:35,760
(Combined with milk tofu,
toasted millet, and other ingredients)

854
00:31:35,760 --> 00:31:36,480
(Savory, rich, and ready
to enjoy straight from the pot)

855
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:38,480
Look at you.

856
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:41,320
Your eyes are lighting up.

857
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:43,840
Alright, I'll dish it out for everyone.

858
00:31:43,840 --> 00:31:44,720
Guys,

859
00:31:44,720 --> 00:31:45,760
bring your bowls over.

860
00:31:45,760 --> 00:31:46,470
Thanks.

861
00:31:46,640 --> 00:31:48,480
Bring your bowls over.

862
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,360
Come on.

863
00:31:49,360 --> 00:31:50,020
These bowls haven't even been used yet.

864
00:31:50,220 --> 00:31:55,180
(Adding toppings for everyone)

865
00:31:55,880 --> 00:31:56,880
