1477
00:51:25,960 --> 00:51:26,320
Look!

1478
00:51:26,320 --> 00:51:26,880
I think it looks pretty good.

1479
00:51:26,880 --> 00:51:27,720
Look at this!

1480
00:51:30,200 --> 00:51:31,240
I just think it's hilarious.

1481
00:51:31,240 --> 00:51:32,280
I'm gonna give them out.

1482
00:51:33,200 --> 00:51:34,480
I'll go now.

1483
00:51:34,480 --> 00:51:35,880
Be right back.

1484
00:51:35,880 --> 00:51:36,420
Okay.

1485
00:51:38,720 --> 00:51:39,920
It's pretty cold.

1486
00:51:43,600 --> 00:51:44,400
Hey!

1487
00:51:46,000 --> 00:51:47,200
Sha Yue'er is upstairs.

1488
00:51:47,200 --> 00:51:49,080
