1491
00:51:55,000 --> 00:51:57,160
Wait,
hers matches this one way too well.

1492
00:51:57,360 --> 00:51:57,920
They're practically identical.

1493
00:51:57,920 --> 00:51:58,880
This one's Fang's.

1494
00:51:59,560 --> 00:52:00,040
This one's yours.

1495
00:52:00,040 --> 00:52:00,680
Hers is actually pretty cute.

1496
00:52:00,680 --> 00:52:02,000
Mine is so ugly!

1497
00:52:02,200 --> 00:52:03,240
This one's Sha Yue'er's.

1498
00:52:03,560 --> 00:52:04,220
Wait,

1499
00:52:04,220 --> 00:52:05,840
