1500
00:52:07,000 --> 00:52:07,680
It suits her perfectly!

1501
00:52:07,680 --> 00:52:09,520
Seriously, look how good hers looks.

1502
00:52:09,920 --> 00:52:11,520
Ours look like this.

1503
00:52:11,920 --> 00:52:13,080
You picked them.

1504
00:52:13,280 --> 00:52:14,440
He picked them.

1505
00:52:15,160 --> 00:52:16,160
It's got a real forest vibe.

1506
00:52:18,680 --> 00:52:19,640
I'm speechless.

1507
00:52:20,120 --> 00:52:21,760
This is too funny.

1508
00:52:21,980 --> 00:52:22,760
Green.

1509
00:52:25,400 --> 00:52:26,080
Cui Kaiyi,

1510
00:52:26,080 --> 00:52:27,320
this one's seriously so ugly.

1511
00:52:29,480 --> 00:52:30,400
Very foresty.

1512
00:52:32,520 --> 00:52:33,520
Alright.

1513
00:52:33,520 --> 00:52:34,360
I'm off.

1514
00:52:34,360 --> 00:52:35,320
Bye.

1515
00:52:35,320 --> 00:52:36,080
I'll take Sha Yue'er's with me.

1516
00:52:36,080 --> 00:52:36,960
That one's Sha Yue'er's.

1517
00:52:36,960 --> 00:52:38,320
- The pink one with the flowers?
- Alright.

1518
00:52:38,320 --> 00:52:38,840
Yep, that's Sha Yue'er's.

1519
00:52:38,840 --> 00:52:39,560
Okay.

1520
00:52:47,300 --> 00:52:48,900
(Bursting out laughing)

1521
00:52:49,840 --> 00:52:51,200
This is too funny!

1522
00:52:52,560 --> 00:52:53,560
And finally, we all come

1523
00:52:53,560 --> 00:52:54,520
