1524
00:52:57,320 --> 00:52:59,200
We're at closing time now.

1525
00:52:59,200 --> 00:53:00,320
This is our final act.

1526
00:53:00,320 --> 00:53:01,280
And we're done.

1527
00:53:01,280 --> 00:53:02,080
Come on.

1528
00:53:02,780 --> 00:53:04,540
(Cueing up the pose)

1529
00:53:10,160 --> 00:53:11,280
I'm gonna hide over here

1530
00:53:11,280 --> 00:53:12,160
and disappear.

1531
00:53:15,480 --> 00:53:15,800
It's a wrap.

1532
00:53:15,800 --> 00:53:16,720
A perfect ending.

1533
00:53:18,280 --> 00:53:19,960
That's hilarious!

1534
00:53:20,820 --> 00:53:22,740
