1535
00:53:22,760 --> 00:53:24,480
You know,
this little lamb's so detailed.

1536
00:53:24,480 --> 00:53:25,560
It's even got fur inside its ears.

1537
00:53:27,920 --> 00:53:28,760
It's really cute.

1538
00:53:28,760 --> 00:53:30,420
It goes perfectly with your outfit.

1539
00:53:30,420 --> 00:53:31,900
(Matching colors)

1540
00:53:32,240 --> 00:53:33,520
It matches your clothes really well too.

1541
00:53:34,880 --> 00:53:36,040
