1543
00:53:39,680 --> 00:53:40,200
Are you cold?

1544
00:53:41,860 --> 00:53:43,100
(Immediately starts shivering)

1545
00:53:43,720 --> 00:53:44,560
A little.

1546
00:53:45,340 --> 00:53:46,740
(Hugging to keep warm)

1547
00:53:47,600 --> 00:53:48,920
Is that the lining

1548
00:53:49,240 --> 00:53:49,800
