1549
00:53:50,080 --> 00:53:51,360
Why don't you put it on for a bit?

1550
00:53:54,690 --> 00:53:56,130
You two need to go back and take

1551
00:53:56,140 --> 00:53:56,500
your

1552
00:53:56,510 --> 00:53:56,920
