1553
00:53:57,560 --> 00:53:58,800
Who do you mean?

1554
00:53:58,800 --> 00:53:59,280
Us.

1555
00:53:59,280 --> 00:54:00,520
We have to take our makeup off.

1556
00:54:01,360 --> 00:54:02,320
Should we head back to our room?

1557
00:54:06,000 --> 00:54:06,360
Well,

1558
00:54:06,360 --> 00:54:08,120
