1559
00:54:08,120 --> 00:54:09,720
That works. I'll just wash my face.

1560
00:54:10,320 --> 00:54:11,880
So you're leaving me here all by myself?

1561
00:54:11,980 --> 00:54:13,500
(Feeling abandoned)

1562
00:54:13,520 --> 00:54:15,120
Yeah, you can go back
and take your makeup off too.

1563
00:54:15,400 --> 00:54:16,760
All three of you are leaving.

1564
00:54:19,480 --> 00:54:20,880
I'll take
my makeup off and come right back.

1565
00:54:21,320 --> 00:54:22,560
I've got makeup remover oil here too.

1566
00:54:22,560 --> 00:54:23,520
Why do you have to go over there?

1567
00:54:23,880 --> 00:54:26,160
That works too.

1568
00:54:26,960 --> 00:54:27,640
Alright.

1569
00:54:27,640 --> 00:54:28,720
You guys get some rest early.

1570
00:54:29,600 --> 00:54:30,320
Let's go.

1571
00:54:35,040 --> 00:54:35,720
Hurry inside.

1572
00:54:35,720 --> 00:54:36,560
It's freezing.

1573
00:54:37,660 --> 00:54:40,060
(Wu Xingying
and Wu Siying return to their room)

1574
00:54:40,640 --> 00:54:41,840
We can take

1575
00:54:41,840 --> 00:54:43,040
