1576
00:54:43,600 --> 00:54:44,400
Yeah.

1577
00:54:46,320 --> 00:54:47,280
Is that my phone

1578
00:54:47,280 --> 00:54:48,080
or yours?

1579
00:54:48,640 --> 00:54:49,440
Mine.

1580
00:54:51,640 --> 00:54:52,440
Hello?

1581
00:54:52,440 --> 00:54:53,300
(Cui Yihang video-calls)

1582
00:54:53,690 --> 00:54:55,080
(Missing each other already)
What are you doing?

1583
00:54:55,080 --> 00:54:56,320
Have you guys gotten ready for bed?

1584
00:54:57,080 --> 00:54:58,080
Almost.

1585
00:54:59,320 --> 00:55:02,080
We're about to change and wash up.

1586
00:55:02,320 --> 00:55:02,720
We already

1587
00:55:02,720 --> 00:55:03,400
started.

1588
00:55:04,760 --> 00:55:06,000
I haven't even taken my makeup off yet.

1589
00:55:06,320 --> 00:55:07,880
Are you guys going straight to bed?

1590
00:55:08,200 --> 00:55:09,000
Yeah.

1591
00:55:10,280 --> 00:55:12,240
We'll go to bed once we're
done taking our makeup off.

1592
00:55:13,200 --> 00:55:14,160
Alright,
you guys take your makeup off first.

1593
00:55:14,160 --> 00:55:14,800
Hurry up.

1594
00:55:14,800 --> 00:55:16,520
We'll go wash up too.

1595
00:55:17,960 --> 00:55:18,480
Bye.

1596
00:55:19,120 --> 00:55:19,920
Bye.

1597
00:55:22,000 --> 00:55:22,800
Bye.

1598
00:55:25,720 --> 00:55:26,920
You two just saw each other.

1599
00:55:26,920 --> 00:55:27,840
Why are you video-calling already?

1600
00:55:27,840 --> 00:55:30,160
You're acting like
you haven't seen each other in ages.

1601
00:55:32,040 --> 00:55:33,280
You two are

1602
00:55:33,280 --> 00:55:34,960
something else.

1603
00:55:34,960 --> 00:55:36,160
Seriously.

1604
00:55:39,160 --> 00:55:39,840
Who is it?

1605
00:55:40,180 --> 00:55:41,780
(Might as well meet in person)

1606
00:55:42,160 --> 00:55:42,520
Hello.

1607
00:55:42,520 --> 00:55:43,440
We...

1608
00:55:43,440 --> 00:55:44,800
We were just about to...

1609
00:55:44,800 --> 00:55:45,840
Hello.

1610
00:55:45,840 --> 00:55:46,760
Why are you wearing a mask?

1611
00:55:46,840 --> 00:55:48,240
Wanna go for a walk?

1612
00:55:49,160 --> 00:55:49,880
Look at you.

1613
00:55:50,840 --> 00:55:51,960
Sure, a walk sounds good.

1614
00:55:52,200 --> 00:55:53,680
You guys need to bundle up.

1615
00:55:54,080 --> 00:55:54,400
Wait.

1616
00:55:54,400 --> 00:55:55,760
You'd better wear pants.

1617
00:55:55,760 --> 00:55:56,880
The wind is really biting out there.

1618
00:55:57,580 --> 00:55:59,580
(Puts on shoes)

1619
00:55:59,600 --> 00:56:00,440
What are you doing?

1620
00:56:00,800 --> 00:56:02,000
I'm wearing my coat.

1621
00:56:02,000 --> 00:56:03,240
It's pretty long.

1622
00:56:03,240 --> 00:56:04,280
No, a coat won't cut it.

1623
00:56:04,280 --> 00:56:05,200
You have to wear a windbreaker.

1624
00:56:05,400 --> 00:56:06,920
Those thin pants
aren't gonna be warm enough.

1625
00:56:06,920 --> 00:56:07,840
Put another pair on.

1626
00:56:07,840 --> 00:56:08,560
(Nagging)
Trust me.

1627
00:56:08,640 --> 00:56:09,920
Is it really that cold outside?

1628
00:56:10,280 --> 00:56:11,520
Just take a few steps outside and see.

1629
00:56:11,520 --> 00:56:12,680
(Nagging +1)
It's freezing.

1630
00:56:12,680 --> 00:56:13,160
The wind's so strong.

1631
00:56:13,160 --> 00:56:14,160
(Nagging +2)
The wind's the worst part.

1632
00:56:14,160 --> 00:56:14,960
(Nagging +3)
Your legs are gonna freeze.

1633
00:56:14,960 --> 00:56:15,640
(Nagging +4)
It's pretty cold.

1634
00:56:15,840 --> 00:56:16,640
Okay.

1635
00:56:19,880 --> 00:56:21,280
You've got
another pair of pants underneath, right?

1636
00:56:21,280 --> 00:56:21,720
Pajama pants.

1637
00:56:21,720 --> 00:56:22,360
Yeah, that'll work.

1638
00:56:22,360 --> 00:56:23,760
Put on your down vest.

1639
00:56:23,760 --> 00:56:24,920
You can just wear

1640
00:56:24,920 --> 00:56:26,680
a down jacket too, babe.

1641
00:56:33,840 --> 00:56:35,600
It really is cold out there.

1642
00:56:36,760 --> 00:56:38,200
Can you go without a mask?

1643
00:56:38,200 --> 00:56:38,800
I'm fine.

1644
00:56:38,800 --> 00:56:39,480
Won't the wind hit your face?

1645
00:56:39,480 --> 00:56:40,280
I'm fine. It's not that windy.

1646
00:56:45,220 --> 00:56:46,630
It's a little cooler outside.

1647
00:56:48,800 --> 00:56:50,640
Okay. It's way too cold.

1648
00:56:54,110 --> 00:56:55,200
Are those boots?

1649
00:56:55,720 --> 00:56:57,160
Tall boots. Knee-high boots.

1650
00:57:00,750 --> 00:57:01,800
What's that?

1651
00:57:02,640 --> 00:57:04,600
Are those boots
comfortable to walk in, babe?

1652
00:57:04,960 --> 00:57:05,640
Yeah, they're fine.

1653
00:57:05,640 --> 00:57:07,080
They'll even
keep the bugs off your legs.

1654
00:57:07,080 --> 00:57:07,880
Really?

1655
00:57:09,400 --> 00:57:11,560
♪Hand in hand, one step, two♪

1656
00:57:11,560 --> 00:57:14,720
♪Three steps, four, gazing at the sky♪

1657
00:57:15,160 --> 00:57:17,760
♪Watching stars, one or two♪

1658
00:57:17,760 --> 00:57:20,360
♪Three and four, they form a line♪

1659
00:57:22,320 --> 00:57:24,120
I can't see many stars out here.

1660
00:57:24,800 --> 00:57:25,720
There are some.

1661
00:57:25,720 --> 00:57:27,920
Actually, if you look closely,
there are quite a few.

1662
00:57:31,240 --> 00:57:32,200
Babe, try standing like this.

1663
00:57:32,880 --> 00:57:33,640
Like this.

1664
00:57:33,640 --> 00:57:34,480
Your waist should

1665
00:57:35,040 --> 00:57:36,360
be bent all the way like this.

1666
00:57:40,140 --> 00:57:43,180
(In sync)

1667
00:57:45,880 --> 00:57:47,480
So many stars.

1668
00:57:48,360 --> 00:57:48,920
Right?

1669
00:57:50,870 --> 00:57:55,080
♪Back to back,
we make a wish in silence♪

1670
00:57:55,300 --> 00:57:57,580
(Looking up)

1671
00:57:57,600 --> 00:57:58,920
There are so many stars.

1672
00:58:00,210 --> 00:58:01,110
They're so bright.

1673
00:58:02,800 --> 00:58:03,440
Look ahead.

1674
00:58:03,440 --> 00:58:05,000
See those three stars?

1675
00:58:05,000 --> 00:58:06,600
They're lined up in a straight line.

1676
00:58:06,600 --> 00:58:07,120
Yeah.

1677
00:58:07,120 --> 00:58:08,200
I can see them. They're so bright.

1678
00:58:08,200 --> 00:58:09,160
They're twinkling.

1679
00:58:12,050 --> 00:58:16,270
♪Back to back,
we make a wish in silence♪

1680
00:58:17,240 --> 00:58:20,480
♪Our dreams will all come true♪
